<a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/06/01/apple-releases-macos-tahoe-26-5-1/">macOS Tahoe also got a 26.5.1 release</a> this week, and it fixes an issue that can affect certain enterprise users on Macs equipped with the latest M5 chip.<br/>
